  "categorias": "Noticias|Sucesos",
  "post_content": "<p>(19 fotos) Poco despu&eacute;s de las 20.30 horas de este lunes se ha producido un accidente a la altura de Natucer cuando una furgoneta conducida por Carlos Hern&aacute;n Rodr&iacute;guez, de 26 a&ntilde;os, de Vila-real, ha chocado contra una farola, ha saltado la mediana y ha parado en el c&eacute;sped de la campa de camiones.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/01/P1360737.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>El conductor, que ha sufrido un leve tir&oacute;n con el cintur&oacute;n, sal&iacute;a de trabajar en el taller Euromaster e iba hacia Vila-real. Han acudido la Polic&iacute;a Local, la Guardia Civil de Onda y los bomberos que, junto a un electricista, han tenido que retirar la farola. Para ello se ha cortado el tr&aacute;fico en ambos sentidos entre las rotondas de Natucer y Cerpa. Despu&eacute;s ha llegado la Guardia Civil de Tr&aacute;fico para realizar el atestado y el tr&aacute;fico se ha restablecido a las 21.10 horas. La ambulancia del servicio vital b&aacute;sico (SVB) ha trasladado al conductor al centro sanitario para observaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360717.jpg\" alt=\"p1360717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360719.jpg\" alt=\"p1360719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360720.jpg\" alt=\"p1360720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360721.jpg\" alt=\"p1360721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360723.jpg\" alt=\"p1360723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360724.jpg\" alt=\"p1360724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360726.jpg\" alt=\"p1360726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360728.jpg\" alt=\"p1360728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360731.jpg\" alt=\"p1360731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360734.jpg\" alt=\"p1360734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360736.jpg\" alt=\"p1360736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360737.jpg\" alt=\"p1360737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360741.jpg\" alt=\"p1360741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360742.jpg\" alt=\"p1360742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360744.jpg\" alt=\"p1360744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360745.jpg\" alt=\"p1360745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360746.jpg\" alt=\"p1360746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360747.jpg\" alt=\"p1360747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentnatucer/p1360748.jpg\" alt=\"p1360748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
